          "prep_note": "for garnish"
        }
      ],
      "instructions": [
        {
          "step": 1,
          "text": "In a heavy saucepan, melt butter. Add garlic, if used. Saut\u00e9 30 seconds. Add onions and potatoes. Saut\u00e9 2 minutes or until onions are heated through."
        },
        {
          "step": 2,
          "text": "Add water. Simmer 15 minutes or until potatoes are cooked. Stir in milk, salt and pepper. Bring to a boil."
        },
        {
          "step": 3,
          "text": "Combine flour with 4 tablespoons water. Mix to make a smooth paste. Stir into boiling mixture. Cook about 4 minutes until thickened."
        },
        {
          "step": 4,
          "text": "Stir in crab and clams in juice. Heat through."
        },
        {
          "step": 5,
          "text": "Ladle into serving bowls. Top each with a dollop of whipped cream. Sprinkle with parsley."
        }
      ],
